# Mona Lisa, Science Geek: a power of 0 or less adds no mana at all. Stab makes her a -1/1 and tapping her leaves the pool empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mona Lisa, Science Geek
Mox Jet
Stab
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mona Lisa, Science Geek.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stab.Cast(Mona Lisa, Science Geek)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mona Lisa, Science Geek.Power = -1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mona Lisa, Science Geek.Activate(Color: Red)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield.Mona Lisa, Science Geek.Tapped = true
